anagement, compensation and benefits, employee relations and implementation of HR policies. • Develop and implement HR policies, procedures, systems and guidelines in line with applicable laws and Company requirements. • Manage manpower planning, workforce analysis and organizational restructuring initiatives. • Coordinate recruitment and selection processes, including preparation of job descriptions, advertisements, shortlisting, interviews and appointment formalities. • Maintain and update organizational structure, sanctioned strength and position-wise manpower records. • Administer employee performance management and appraisal systems. • Coordinate development and implementation of Key Performance Indicators (KPIs). • Manage compensation, benefits, allowances, increments, promotions and other employee-related matters. • Coordinate training needs analysis, annual training plans, training calendars and employee development programs. • Develop succession planning and career development initiatives. • Handle employee grievances, disciplinary matters and employee relations in accordance with Company policy. • Ensure proper maintenance and confidentiality of personnel records and HR information. • Prepare HR reports, dashboards, manpower statistics and management briefs. • Coordinate with regulatory authorities, auditors and other stakeholders on HR-related matters. • Support management in policy formulation, organizational development and HR-related projects. • Ensure compliance with applicable labour laws, service regulations and Company policies. • Supervise and guide HR staff and ensure timely completion of departmental assignments Read More Eligibility Criteria Experience 6 Years Age Limit Max: 35 years','2026-09-11 23:27:22.209710','Contract','2026-09-11 23:27:22.209723','hr',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(85,'Manager Internal Audit','National Insurance Company Limited','Pakistan','','6 Years+','','[]','Expired On Sep 11, 2026','https://www.njp.gov.pk/jobs/9620','njp','CA