, and Web. You will bridge the gap between native performance and cross-platform efficiency, ensuring a unified user experience while maintaining a highly maintainable codebase.Key ResponsibilitiesArchitecture & Shared Development: Design, build, and maintain clean, scalable multiplatform architectures. Write reusable business logic (networking, data persistence, and state management) using KMP.UI Engineering: Create responsive, high-performance user interfaces using Compose Multiplatform, ensuring visual consistency across all target platforms.Native Integration: Implement platform-specific code and native API bridges using Kotlin\'s expect/actual mechanisms or Swift/Objective-C interop when required.API Integration: Integrate asynchronous backend services, RESTful APIs, and WebSockets using Kotlin-native libraries like Ktor.Lifecycle & Performance Management: Optimize app performance, memory footprints, and startup times across both Android and iOS execution environments.Testing & Quality Assurance: Author comprehensive unit, integration, and UI tests for shared modules. Conduct rigorous peer code reviews to maintain code quality.CI/CD Automation: Collaborate with DevOps to set up and optimize build pipelines for cross-platform artifacts (e.g., KMP frameworks for iOS via CocoaPods or Swift Package Manager).Requirements & QualificationsExperience: 3+ years of hands-on experience working with Kotlin Multiplatform (KMP) and Compose Multiplatform (CMP) in a production environment, alongside 5+ years of overall mobile or software engineering experience.Language Proficiency: Expert-level command of Kotlin, with a solid understanding of Swift, Objective-C, and native iOS development patterns.Asynchronous Programming: Deep knowledge of Kotlin Coroutines and Flow for reactive stream management and multi-threaded processing.Modern Mobile Stack: Proven experience with Jetpack Compose, Ktor, SQLDelight/Room, and dependency injection frameworks (e.g., Koin, Hilt).Architecture Patterns: Mastery of MVVM or MVI architectures and multiplatform navigation components (e.g., Voyager, Decompose).Tooling & Infrastructure: High proficiency with Android Studio, Xcode, Gradle build configurations, and cross-platform debugging tools.Education: Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field (or equivalent practical experience).','2026-09-11 23:38:31.658029','Full-time','2026-09-11 23:38:31.658052','mobile',12,1500,1200,NULL),(142,'UI/UX Designer','Nokhba.AI','','PKR 75,000 - 150,000 /month','','','[]','2026-09-07','https://www.mustakbil.com/jobs/job/1434745','mustakbil','Job Description : Nokhba.AI is seeking a UI/UX Designer to help create simple, intuitive, and engaging digital experiences. In this role, you will contribute to user-friendly products and help shape product experiences and customer journeys through thoughtful design. Responsibilities: Design intuitive and engaging user interfaces. Create wireframes, prototypes, and high-fidelity designs. Understand user needs and translate them into effective design solutions. Collaborate with product managers and developers. Maintain consistent design systems and UI components. Improve designs based on user feedback and testing. Ensure responsive and user-friendly experiences across platforms. Job Specification : Experience in UI/UX or product design. Strong knowledge of UX principles and design processes. Proficiency in Figma or similar design tools. Good understanding of responsive and modern UI design. Strong creative and problem-solving skills. Excellent attention to detail. Portfolio demonstrating previous UI/UX work.','2026-09-13 20:39:47.996612','Full-time','2026-09-11 23:51:43.661474','design',NULL,150000,75000,NULL),(143,'Operations Coordinator','Nokhba.AI','','PKR 95,000 - 190,000 /month','','','[]','2026-09-07','https://www.mustakbil.com/jobs/job/1434744','mustakbil','Job Description : Nokhba.AI is an AI-powered HR technology company helping businesses improve recruitment through modern SaaS solutions. We are seeking an organized and proactive Operations Coordinator to support daily operations in Lahore. This role coordinates activities across teams, maintains accurate documentation, and helps ensure internal processes are completed efficiently and on time. Key responsibilities: Coordinate daily operational activities and internal workflows across teams. Track tasks, deadlines, follow-ups, meetings, schedules, and action items. Maintain operational records, reports, documentation, and standard operating procedures. Communicate with internal teams to resolve operational issues and support cross-team coordination. Assist with recruitment, customer support, sales, administrative operations, onboarding, and special projects as required. Monitor processes, identify improvement opportunities, and support process automation and technology adoption. Coordinate with vendors, partners, and service providers when needed. Prepare regular operational reports and performance updates while keeping information organized and accessible. Job Specification : 1–3 years of experience in operations, coordination, administration, project coordination, or a related field. Strong organizational, time-management, prioritization, and follow-up skills. Excellent written and verbal communication with strong interpersonal abilities. Ability to manage multiple tasks independently and collaboratively while maintaining attention to detail. Practical problem-solving skills and the ability to coordinate effectively across teams. Proficiency in Google Workspace, Microsoft Office, spreadsheets, and collaboration tools. Familiarity with CRM, HR, project management, or SaaS platforms is advantageous. Experience in HR technology, SaaS, recruitment, or technology companies is a plus.','2026-09-13 20:39:48.001977','Full-time','2026-09-11 23:51:43.666634','administration',NULL,190000,95000,NULL),(144,'Implementation and Onboarding Specialist','Nokhba.AI','','PKR 100,000 - 200,000 /month','','','[]','2026-09-07','https://www.mustakbil.com/jobs/job/1434740','mustakbil','Job Description : Nokhba.AI is seeking a proactive, customer-focused Implementation and Onboarding Specialist to help B2B customers successfully adopt its AI-powered HR technology platform. Based in Lahore, this remote role supports customers from initial onboarding through platform adoption, ensuring they understand the product, workflows, and capabilities needed to achieve their recruitment goals. Key Responsibilities Manage the end-to-end onboarding process for new B2B customers. Understand customer requirements and configure appropriate onboarding plans. Conduct product demonstrations, training sessions, and platform walkthroughs. Coordinate account setup, data requirements, integrations, and implementation activities. Create onboarding timelines and ensure implementation milestones are completed on schedule. Collaborate with Sales, Customer Success, Product, and Technical teams to resolve challenges. Monitor customer progress, adoption, activation, time-to-value, and onboarding completion. Maintain accurate documentation and develop onboarding guides, training materials, FAQs, and standard processes. Gather customer feedback and communicate product improvement opportunities internally. Conduct post-implementation follow-ups and help improve scalable onboarding processes as the customer base grows. Job Specification : Customer onboarding, implementation, customer success, or account management experience in a B2B SaaS environment. Strong understanding of B2B SaaS customer journeys and product adoption principles. Excellent communication, presentation, training, and stakeholder-management skills. Ability to understand customer requirements and translate them into practical solutions. Strong project coordination, organization, documentation, and problem-solving abilities. Comfort working with technology platforms and SaaS products. Customer-first mindset 