other beverages. Ability to operate and maintain coffee machines and bar equipment. Strong communication and customer-service skills. Ability to maintain hygiene, cleanliness, and food-safety standards. Ability to work effectively in a fast-paced environment. Energetic, reliable, and well-presented.','2026-09-13 20:39:48.077400','Full-time','2026-09-12 00:07:06.545423','other',NULL,35000,30000,NULL),(192,'Outdoor Sales Executive','Quick Roadways Transport','Dubai, AE','AED 2,500 - 3,000 /month','','','[]','2026-09-06','https://ae.mustakbil.com/jobs/job/1434699','mustakbil','Job Description : Quick Roadways Transport is a passenger transportation company serving the UAE market. We are seeking an Outdoor Sales Executive to develop business opportunities and strengthen relationships with corporate clients, travel partners, hotels, and other organizations in Dubai. Identify and approach prospective clients and business partners across Dubai. Present transportation services, prepare suitable proposals, and explain service benefits. Arrange client meetings, conduct sales visits, and maintain an organized prospect pipeline. Build long-term relationships with corporate accounts, travel agencies, hotels, and event-related customers. Coordinate with operations and customer service teams to support accurate quotations and smooth service delivery. Track market activity, competitor offerings, sales results, and customer feedback. Prepare regular sales updates and work toward agreed business development targets. Job Specification : Demonstrated ability to perform outdoor sales, business development, or field-based account acquisition. Strong communication, presentation, negotiation, and relationship-building skills. Ability to identify prospects, arrange appointments, deliver service presentations, and close opportunities. Professional follow-up habits with accurate records of leads, meetings, quotations, and results. Understanding of corporate sales, travel trade, hospitality, or passenger transportation markets is beneficial. Confident use of email, spreadsheets, customer databases, and basic sales reporting tools. Self-motivated, target-oriented, well organized, and comfortable working independently in the field. Professional conduct and strong customer service when representing the company with clients and partners. Job Rewards and Benefits : Transport','2026-09-13 20:39:48.080331','Full-time','2026-09-12 00:07:06.550193','sales',NULL,3000,2500,NULL),(193,'Business Development Executive','Zayah Software Solutions','Doha, QA','QAR 2,500 - 3,500 /month','','','[]','2026-09-05','https://qa.mustakbil.com/jobs/job/1434697','mustakbil','Job Description : Business Development Executive – Field Sales | Doha Zayah Software Solutions is expanding its sales presence in Qatar and is looking for a confident Business Development Executive to introduce ClinicOS to private clinics in Doha. ClinicOS is a Revenue Operating System for clinics. It helps clinics convert WhatsApp enquiries into appointments, automatically follow up with interested leads who do not book, reduce repetitive front-desk work, and track booked and recovered revenue through a live dashboard. This is a hands-on field sales role. You will visit clinics in person, speak with clinic managers and owners, demonstrate ClinicOS, and identify clinics interested in joining our 30-day founding pilot. Responsibilities Visit private clinics across Doha in person Approach clinic managers, owners and decision-makers Deliver short 3–5 minute live product demonstrations Explain how ClinicOS can improve enquiry conversion and recover lost revenue Identify and qualify potential clinic clients Follow up with interested clinics Secure pilot opportunities and signed agreements Maintain accurate records of clinic visits Job Specification : Previous experience in sales, business development, outdoor sales or B2B sales Comfortable approaching businesses without a prior appointment Strong communication and presentation skills Professional and well-presented Confident speaking with business owners and managers Self-motivated, organised and target-focused Currently based in Qatar Strong English required Arabic is an advantage Own transportation is an advantage Experience in healthcare, medical sales, SaaS, telecom, POS systems or other B2B products is an advantage Job Rewards and Benefits : Incentive Bonus','2026-09-13 20:39:48.083256','Full-time','2026-09-12 00:07:06.555578','sales',NULL,3500,2500,NULL),(194,'HR Advisory & Career Consultant','Nokhba.AI','','PKR 95,000 - 190,000 /month','','','[]','2026-09-05','https://www.mustakbil.com/jobs/job/1434696','mustakbil','Job Description : Nokhba.AI is an AI-powered recruitment and career platform that helps companies improve hiring and supports candidates in making better career decisions. We are looking for an HR Advisory & Career Consultant to advise candidates on their careers while contributing to HR and recruitment practices across the platform. The role combines candidate-facing career coaching with internal HR advisory work. Responsibilities: Conduct one-to-one online career advisory sessions with candidates. Understand candidates’ goals, experience, challenges, and career aspirations. Provide career strategy, planning, interview preparation, and transition guidance. Advise candidates on salary expectations and negotiation approaches. Help candidates identify their strengths, skills, and suitable opportunities. Advise on HR practices, policies, and workflows across the platform. Support the development of HR processes, content, and services. Contribute to recruitment process design and day-to-day execution. Partner with the team to improve platform support for candidates, recruiters, and employers. Work arrangement: Remote or online work from Lahore. Morning shift. Full-time employment. Job Specification : HR, talent advisory, recruitment, or career coaching experience. Strong knowledge of HR practices, recruitment processes, and workforce trends. Understanding of salary trends and career development approaches. Confidence conducting one-to-one conversations with people from varied backgrounds. Strong communication, active listening, empathy, and coaching skills. Ability to provide practical career strategy, interview, and transition guidance. Ability to contribute to HR process design, content development, and service improvement. Strong organization, judgment, and ability to work collaboratively.','2026-09-13 20:39:48.086268','Full-time','2026-09-12 00:07:06.560439','hr',NULL,190000,95000,NULL),(195,'Devops Engineer','Nokhba.AI','','PKR 50,000 - 100,000 /month','','','[]','2026-09-05','https://www.mustakbil.com/jobs/job/1434695','mustakbil','Job Description : Nokhba.AI is seeking a part-time DevOps Engineer to maintain, secure, and improve its remote cloud infrastructure as the platform grows. The role works closely with the development team to keep infrastructure stable, scalable, secure, and cost-efficient. Responsibilities Manage cloud and server infrastructure, production and development environments. Set up and maintain CI/CD pipelines for reliable application deployments. Monitor system performance, application availability, infrastructure health, logs, and backups. Configure and maintain domains, DNS, SSL certificates, servers, firewalls, and related infrastructure. Troubleshoot production incidents, downtime, performance issues, and deployment problems. Apply security updates and manage access, credentials, environment variables, and deployment configurations securely. Optimize infrastructure and reduce unnecessary hosting or cloud costs. Document infrastructure, deployment, backup, and recovery procedures. Help prepare the platform for future growth and increased user traffic. Job Specification : Strong Linux server administration and infrastructure management skills. Hands-on experience with cloud platforms such as AWS, Azure, Google Cloud, or similar. Experience building and maintaining CI/CD pipelines and Git/GitHub deployment workflows. Good knowledge of Docker and containerized applications. Understanding of networking, DNS, SSL certificates, firewalls, and server security. Experience with monitoring, logging, backups, recovery, and production troubleshooting. Ability to work independently, resolve infrastructure issues, and communicate clearly through technical documentation. Experience with AI or SaaS platforms, PostgreSQL or relational databases, Redis, Nginx, cloud cost optimization, or data-protection practices is an advantage.','2026-09-13 20:39:48.089275','Full-time','2026-09-12 00:07:06.563225','devops',NULL,100000,50000,NULL),(196,'Sales Closer / Lead Gen Bestie','Inten Socials','','PKR 30,000 - 100,000 /month','','','[]','2026-09-05','https://www.mustakbil.com/jobs/job/1434692','mustakbil','Job Description : About the role Part-time remote sales role focused on lead generation, closing deals, and building an early-stage business. This is commission-based to start, with potential to move into a paid role as growth milestones are reached. Responsibilities Call prospects and pitch products or services. Handle objections. Close deals and follow up consistently. Keep the lead pipeline organized. Report on outcomes. Maintain resilience during slower periods. Job Specification : Sales and closing Cold calling Lead generation Objection handling Business development Written and verbal communication Negotiation Self-motivation and resilience Social media knowledge preferred but not required Job Rewards and Benefits : Communication,Leaves','2026-09-13 20:39:48.092226','Part-time','2026-09-12 00:07:06.566192','sales',NULL,100000,30000,NULL),(197,'Finance Manager','Perfumes Hub','Lahore, PK','PKR 50,000 - 60,000 /month','','','[]','2026-09-05','https://www.mustakbil.com/jobs/job/1434691','mustakbil','Job Description : Perfumes Hub is a Lahore-based sole proprietorship in the health, wellness and fitness sector, focused on del